9	 * DTO) and the create endpoint (to detect duplicates). The identity key is the full lower-case hex
10	 * SHA-256 over {@code normalizedTelephone + '|' + lowerEmail + '|' + soundex(lastName)}.
11	 *
12	 * <p>Kept as a plain utility class (rather than default methods on the mapper) so MapStruct does not
13	 * mistake these {@code String -> String} helpers for candidate property mapping methods.
14	 */
